### Eliminar referencia por locationId — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": 4138
}

### Eliminar referencia por privateCode — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "privateCode": "BG-NEW"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": 4138
}

### Sin locationId ni privateCode → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": null,
  "privateCode": null
}

### LocationId inexistente → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": 999999999
}
